&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;(注)　１　算定範囲は三浦工業単体であります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;２　株式会社リンクアンドモチベーション「モチベーションクラウド」によるエンゲージメントレーディングで&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;　　あります。エンゲージメントスコアとは、従業員の企業に対する愛着や相互理解、相思相愛度合いを数値化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;　　した偏差値であります。「50」が全参加企業・組織の平均となります。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetricsMetricsAndTargetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">女性管理監督者比率</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">2027年度末</jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">％</jpcrp_cor:MetricsUnitDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
  <jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">有給休暇取得率</jpcrp_cor:MetricsDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
